{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29176","headline":"新兴道中 · 许浑","name":"新兴道中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"芙蓉村步失官金，折狱无功不可寻。\n初挂海帆逢岁暮，却开山馆值春深。\n波浑未辨鱼龙迹，雾暗宁知蚌鹬心。\n夜榜归舟望渔火，一溪风雨两岩阴。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29176.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29176","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}